  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MULTISECTORIAL PREINVESTMENT PROGRAM IV (CCLIP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PROGRAMA MULTISECTORIAL DE PREINVERSION IV (CCLIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El Programa tendr como objetivo general aumentar la productividad de la inversin pblica nacional y provincial para contriuir al desarrollo econmico y social del pas, mediante la elaboracin de estudiois generales y especficos de preinversin en reas y sectores estratgicos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to increase the efficiency, optimal allocation, and the productivity of the public investment that contributes to the economic and social developments of the country through the elaboration of general and specific pre-investment studies.</narrative>
  </description>
